{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"867300973532938280","content":"\"||Sounds like a good plan. Looks like that's all we might find out for now without alerting them. We'll be heading back to the City before dawn. Anything you'd like us to do along the way aside from having some target practice?||\"","created_at":"2021-07-30T08:55:27.991000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870590407732494348","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
